// ── Unit 3: Sport — Adjectives & Comparatives ──
u2l0w0:['DPG',"Do you do athletics, or do you play a team sport?","I do athletics. I run the 400 metres, and I also play volleyball at weekends.",
        'CMP',"Is athletics harder than swimming?","I think athletics is harder because the training is more intense and more boring."],
